{"parse": {"title": "UTTU闪烁集会", "pageid": 107240, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"preamble\">\n    <div class=\"preamble-background\"></div>\n    <div class=\"preamble-content\"><p>“新一期特别阅读挑战，来自神秘学界知名杂志《UTTU》的邀请。”</p><p>无数神秘学家为之痴迷的UTTU闪烁集会，首次出现在遥远的香槟平原之上。</p></div>\n</div>\n<p>UTTU闪烁集会是一类<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B4%BB%E5%8A%A8%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8#限时季度挑战\" title=\"活动列表\">限时季度挑战</a>活动，通常自下半阶段开启后持续14天，商店持续开放到版本结束，主要奖励为低星角色衣着、限定头像和共鸣晶匣。\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".E6.9C.BA.E5.88.B6\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"机制\">机制</span></h2>\n<p>UTTU闪烁集会中，大多数关卡可携带“名人卡”，且可在特定关卡中解锁卡位数量。携带“名人卡”可获得卡面上提供的加成效果。除此以外，除实际参战的角色外，维尔汀可携带特别的名人卡为战局提供加成效果。\n</p><p>相比于<a href=\"/index.php?title=UTTU%E8%81%9A%E5%85%89%E4%B8%93%E6%A0%8F&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"UTTU聚光专栏（页面不存在）\">UTTU聚光专栏</a>，该系列的独有特性在于：\n</p>\n<ul><li>不能在关卡中使用他人的协助角色；</li>\n<li>名人卡册中，缴纳三张同品质名人卡，可合并一张更高品质且未拥有的名人卡；</li>\n<li>UTTU闪烁集会不依据总关卡花费回合数评判。</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\".E5.85.B3.E5.8D.A1.E5.88.86.E5.B8.83\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"关卡分布\">关卡分布</span></h2>\n<p>UTTU闪烁集会中有如下几类可参与关卡（往期可能不全都有）：\n</p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>UTTU超级市场：</b></span>集会的中心，可以在其中阅读“闪烁总刊”，即参与挑战，完成可解锁相关文本及剧情，并获得大量<span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"2/1112\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/UTTU%E8%B4%AD%E7%89%A9%E7%A5%A8%E6%8D%AE\" title=\"UTTU购物票据\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/UTTU%E8%B4%AD%E7%89%A9%E7%A5%A8%E6%8D%AE\" title=\"UTTU购物票据\"><img alt=\"UTTU购物票据\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/CurrencyItem-214.png/100px-CurrencyItem-214.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/CurrencyItem-214.png/150px-CurrencyItem-214.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/CurrencyItem-214.png/200px-CurrencyItem-214.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/UTTU%E8%B4%AD%E7%89%A9%E7%A5%A8%E6%8D%AE\" title=\"UTTU购物票据\">UTTU购物票据</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">由《UTTU》杂志提供的票据，可于[市场货架]处进行兑换。<br />仅限[UTTU闪烁集会-昨日金杯]活动举办期间使用。</span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>UTTU零售：</b></span>可以在其中阅读“闪烁侧刊”，即花费<span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"2/1111\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8F%AF%E9%98%85%E6%AC%A1%E6%95%B0\" title=\"可阅次数\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8F%AF%E9%98%85%E6%AC%A1%E6%95%B0\" title=\"可阅次数\"><img alt=\"可阅次数\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/CurrencyItem-100102.png/100px-CurrencyItem-100102.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/CurrencyItem-100102.png/150px-CurrencyItem-100102.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/CurrencyItem-100102.png/200px-CurrencyItem-100102.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8F%AF%E9%98%85%E6%AC%A1%E6%95%B0\" title=\"可阅次数\">可阅次数</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">此为“闪烁侧刊”扉页上的一句友善的提醒。可用于挑战UTTU零售。<br />仅限[UTTU闪烁集会]举办期间使用。<br /><span style=\"color:#e47124\">活动期间每日5：00（UTC+8）自动获得5次</span></span></span></span>（活动期间每天5:00自动获得5次，最多储存10次。），并选择挑战篇章（系列卡组）进行战斗，可随机获得系列中的几张名人卡。完成“精读条例”可额外掉落。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>试用关：</b></span>使用给定的角色和名人卡完成试用关卡，完成后可获得高品质名人卡，多用于体验最近的角色或体系。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>特贩周：</b></span>通关全部主关卡后可解锁，含有更具挑战性的5关。完成后可获得<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%85%BB%E6%88%90%E6%9D%90%E6%96%99\" title=\"养成材料\">养成材料</a>。</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\".E5.BE.80.E6.9C.9F.E6.8C.91.E6.88.98\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"往期挑战\">往期挑战</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable center mw-collapsible\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width: 1020px;\" colspan=\"5\">限时季度挑战\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>活动</th>\n<th>时间</th>\n<th>类型\n</th>\n<th class=\"hide-m\">收藏奖励\n</th>\n<th class=\"hide-m\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"6\" style=\"background: #193b47; color: #c2cfd4; font-size: 15px; text-align: center;\"><b>2023年</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/UTTU%E9%97%AA%E7%83%81%E9%9B%86%E4%BC%9A%C2%B7%E6%98%A8%E6%97%A5%E9%87%91%E6%9D%AF\" title=\"UTTU闪烁集会·昨日金杯\">昨日金杯</a> <br /> <small style=\"color: #999;\">Trophy of the Past Glory</small>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-left\"><span class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block; text-indent: initial; background: #C54413; color: #fff; padding: 0em 0.5em 0.05em; border-radius: 0.75em; font-size: 13px; vertical-align: 0.1em;\">1.1</span> 07/06 - 07/20</td>\n<td>闪烁集会\n</td>\n<td class=\"hide-m text-left\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"302803\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E8%83%A1%E5%A3%AB%E6%89%98%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%9E%E5%A3%B0\" title=\"衣着/胡士托的回声\"><img alt=\"Bgequip5.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/100px-Bgequip5.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/150px-Bgequip5.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/200px-Bgequip5.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E8%83%A1%E5%A3%AB%E6%89%98%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%9E%E5%A3%B0\" title=\"胡士托的回声\"><img alt=\"胡士托的回声\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/Item_heroskin-302803.png/100px-Item_heroskin-302803.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/Item_heroskin-302803.png/150px-Item_heroskin-302803.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/Item_heroskin-302803.png/200px-Item_heroskin-302803.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E8%83%A1%E5%A3%AB%E6%89%98%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%9E%E5%A3%B0\" title=\"衣着/胡士托的回声\">胡士托的回声</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">绅士的躁动，富含维生素C的靡靡之音。</span></span></span> <br /> <span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/170101\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%80%AA%E7%9B%97%E8%92%99%E5%A4%AA%E5%A5%87\" title=\"怪盗蒙太奇\"><img alt=\"Bgequip5.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/100px-Bgequip5.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/150px-Bgequip5.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/200px-Bgequip5.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:64%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%80%AA%E7%9B%97%E8%92%99%E5%A4%AA%E5%A5%87\" title=\"怪盗蒙太奇\"><img alt=\"怪盗蒙太奇\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/Item-170101.png/100px-Item-170101.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/da/Item-170101.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%80%AA%E7%9B%97%E8%92%99%E5%A4%AA%E5%A5%87\" title=\"怪盗蒙太奇\">怪盗蒙太奇</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">一段过往的掠影，一些时代的片段，一份珍贵的纪念。谨以此物，为见证诸多故事的朋友们献上诚挚的敬意。<br />可于个人信息界面作为头像使用。</span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"hide-m\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Banner_%E6%98%A8%E6%97%A5%E9%87%91%E6%9D%AF.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Banner 昨日金杯.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/Banner_%E6%98%A8%E6%97%A5%E9%87%91%E6%9D%AF.png/400px-Banner_%E6%98%A8%E6%97%A5%E9%87%91%E6%9D%AF.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"70\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/Banner_%E6%98%A8%E6%97%A5%E9%87%91%E6%9D%AF.png/600px-Banner_%E6%98%A8%E6%97%A5%E9%87%91%E6%9D%AF.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/Banner_%E6%98%A8%E6%97%A5%E9%87%91%E6%9D%AF.png/800px-Banner_%E6%98%A8%E6%97%A5%E9%87%91%E6%9D%AF.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1202\" data-file-height=\"210\" /></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/UTTU%E9%97%AA%E7%83%81%E9%9B%86%E4%BC%9A%C2%B7%E5%A4%9C%E8%AE%BF%E5%B9%BD%E6%BD%AD\" title=\"UTTU闪烁集会·夜访幽潭\">夜访幽潭</a> <br /> <small style=\"color: #999;\">A Night Visit to the Lake</small>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-left\"><span class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block; text-indent: initial; background: #325832; color: #fff; padding: 0em 0.5em 0.05em; border-radius: 0.75em; font-size: 13px; vertical-align: 0.1em;\">1.2</span> 08/17 - 08/31</td>\n<td>闪烁集会\n</td>\n<td class=\"hide-m text-left\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"300603\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E7%AC%AC%E5%85%AD%E6%84%9F\" title=\"衣着/第六感\"><img alt=\"Bgequip5.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/100px-Bgequip5.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/150px-Bgequip5.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/200px-Bgequip5.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E7%AC%AC%E5%85%AD%E6%84%9F\" title=\"第六感\"><img alt=\"第六感\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/Item_heroskin-300603.png/100px-Item_heroskin-300603.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/Item_heroskin-300603.png/150px-Item_heroskin-300603.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/Item_heroskin-300603.png/200px-Item_heroskin-300603.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E7%AC%AC%E5%85%AD%E6%84%9F\" title=\"衣着/第六感\">第六感</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">只工作，不玩闹，聪明雀儿也……</span></span></span> <br /> <span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/170201\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BB%BF%E6%B9%96%E5%A6%96%E8%B0%AD\" title=\"绿湖妖谭\"><img alt=\"Bgequip5.png\" src=\"https://huij